Package: forge.editor
Type: Package
Title: In-Browser R Code Editor (CodeMirror 6) for Shiny
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("John", "Coene", email = "jcoenep@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An htmlwidget that embeds the forge.editor JavaScript library
    (a CodeMirror 6-based R code editor) in R, RStudio Viewer, and Shiny
    applications. Supports static-catalog autocomplete out of the box and
    optional live LSP-backed completion, hover, and diagnostics via R's
    'languageserver' package when used inside a Shiny session.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    htmlwidgets,
    shiny,
    later,
    processx
Suggests:
    languageserver
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
